{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは\n愛知県出身21歳の岡本姫奈です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "3週に渡って放送されました\n「乃木坂工事中 大運動会」\n観てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次の日筋肉痛で動けなかったくらい！本気出した！😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大人になっても全力で運動会ができるなんて…！！！！\n毎年やりたいくらい 楽しかったです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩や同期 後輩ちゃんとの距離も\nぐっと近くなりました☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして何より、バナナマンさんのお二人とも\nたくさん距離を縮めることができました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しい〜！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "‎綱引き最強軍団‎🤍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobwEMyZ3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/moboRteZO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしい〜！っていいながら撮った📸\n昔流行ったよね笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっと心の準備してみてね⬇️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobsqN3jt.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobm5ek3f.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハチマキをリボンにしてたのも チアも本当に可愛かったし、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リレーで走ってる姿もかっこよかった〜！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同じチームで嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "来年も一緒のチームで出ましょうよ〜、、。☹️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobXfgWtT.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は猫耳アレンジしてみた🐱\n学校でやったら先生に絶対怒られるやつ笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "YouTubeで何度も見返せるので沢山観てね👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "反省点があるとしたら\n棒ぶら下がり1分の競技\n日村さんの声掛けが嬉しかったんだけど\n顔みたら口元が緩んじゃって、、\n力が抜けて本当に危なかった笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前編\nhttps://youtu.be/-kutrc11lZE?si=17a6k31zK1zRRCb3"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "後編\nhttps://youtu.be/sYA7dBqUEHg?si=Z0FDv3XS9NMLthfm"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "完結編\nhttps://youtu.be/rigDP1QL4EM?si=3iQmYco2WrGQWbfH"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の一曲\n青春のパズルは埋まらない/iLiFE!さん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "11月23日に開催される\n「おかひな時間公開収録」まであと少しです☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ち遠しいよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}